{"824720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pure Rock Crawling", "steam_appid": 824720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<strong>Pure Rock Crawling</strong> is a physics based off-road simulator. Developed by one developer. <br>Immerse yourself in the world of rock crawling as you drive capable off-road trucks. Featuring soft body tires physics, complex drivetrain simulation, maps made with photogrammetry, visual and mechanical customization.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/c3d83a3de589439ef904864b7862e29b.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/c3d83a3de589439ef904864b7862e29b.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/c3d83a3de589439ef904864b7862e29b.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Suspension customization - equip a variety of addons that affect your riding characteristics. Different suspension types, flexible tires and lift kits. All physics based providing true to life suspension articulation and tire deformation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/17af0d23093f22e17514bfad0785bb7a.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/17af0d23093f22e17514bfad0785bb7a.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/17af0d23093f22e17514bfad0785bb7a.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Visual customization - choose between many bumpers, doors, roof addons, fenders, vinyl wraps and decals. Make your ride your own and hit the trails with style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2ba15752078b12024478839d351a0ff9.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2ba15752078b12024478839d351a0ff9.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2ba15752078b12024478839d351a0ff9.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge yourself on marked trails or just roam around. Pure Rock Crawling is a free roam game that offers additional challenges in the form of completing the trails. Main focus is to provide you a playground for best rock crawling experience in a physics based simulation of suspension and tires.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2572c281a3df16c5c005429e73866481.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2572c281a3df16c5c005429e73866481.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2572c281a3df16c5c005429e73866481.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore variety of maps, take on challenges and have fun rock crawling !<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/69a393b4c57386c70318115b403e2fd9.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/69a393b4c57386c70318115b403e2fd9.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/69a393b4c57386c70318115b403e2fd9.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Pure Rock Crawling</strong> is a physics based off-road simulator. Developed by one developer. <br>Immerse yourself in the world of rock crawling as you drive capable off-road trucks. Featuring soft body tires physics, complex drivetrain simulation, maps made with photogrammetry, visual and mechanical customization.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/c3d83a3de589439ef904864b7862e29b.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/c3d83a3de589439ef904864b7862e29b.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/c3d83a3de589439ef904864b7862e29b.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Suspension customization - equip a variety of addons that affect your riding characteristics. Different suspension types, flexible tires and lift kits. All physics based providing true to life suspension articulation and tire deformation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/17af0d23093f22e17514bfad0785bb7a.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/17af0d23093f22e17514bfad0785bb7a.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/17af0d23093f22e17514bfad0785bb7a.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Visual customization - choose between many bumpers, doors, roof addons, fenders, vinyl wraps and decals. Make your ride your own and hit the trails with style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2ba15752078b12024478839d351a0ff9.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2ba15752078b12024478839d351a0ff9.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2ba15752078b12024478839d351a0ff9.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge yourself on marked trails or just roam around. Pure Rock Crawling is a free roam game that offers additional challenges in the form of completing the trails. Main focus is to provide you a playground for best rock crawling experience in a physics based simulation of suspension and tires.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2572c281a3df16c5c005429e73866481.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2572c281a3df16c5c005429e73866481.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/2572c281a3df16c5c005429e73866481.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore variety of maps, take on challenges and have fun rock crawling !<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/69a393b4c57386c70318115b403e2fd9.poster.avif?t=1779279101\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/69a393b4c57386c70318115b403e2fd9.webm?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/extras/69a393b4c57386c70318115b403e2fd9.mp4?t=1779279101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "short_description": "Pure Rock Crawling is a physics based off-road simulator. Featuring soft body tires, suspension customization that affects your handling, true to life drivetrain simulation and visual addons. Explore a variety of trails in free roam with multiple challenges.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/header.jpg?t=1779279101", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779279101", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/824720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779279101", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 850m or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recom